# SPDX-License-Identifier: MPL-2.0
import lib/cadkernel/curve2.dl

function check curve2 ownership {boolean:condition}:
    execute:
        if condition = false:
            @intrinsic("call", "libc", "exit", nothing, 93)
function owned curve2 polyline:
    execute:
        set vertices to a list containing (a cad polyline vertex2 at (the cad zero vector2) with bulge 1.0)
        append (a straight cad polyline vertex2 at (a cad vector2 with x 2.0 and y 0.0)) to vertices
        set shape to the cad polyline2 with vertices vertices and closure false
        replace item at index 0 in vertices with (a straight cad polyline vertex2 at (a cad vector2 with x 50.0 and y 50.0))
        free vertices
        set result to the cad curve2 of shape
        free cad polyline shape
        return result
function owned curve2 nurbs:
    execute:
        set controls to a list containing (the cad zero vector2)
        append (a cad vector2 with x 2.0 and y 0.0) to controls
        set scalars to an empty list of a 64 bit floating-point number
        set result to the cad nurbs curve2 of degree 1 with controls controls, knots scalars and weights scalars
        free controls
        free scalars
        set shape to the cad curve2 of result's value
        set result to a new (the type of result)
        return shape
function check carried curve2 {cad curve2:shape}:
    execute:
        set point to the cad point on shape at 0.5
        check curve2 ownership ((the absolute value of (point's x - 1.0)) < 1e-12)

set primitive to the cad curve2 of (a cad line2 from (the cad zero vector2) to (a cad vector2 with x 1.0 and y 1.0))
check curve2 ownership (primitive's nurbs's owner = (0 as a pointer to an integer))
check curve2 ownership (primitive's polyline's storage's owner = (0 as a pointer to an integer))
set first to owned curve2 polyline
set shared to first
set copied to the cad clone of first
check curve2 ownership (first = shared)
check curve2 ownership (first = copied)
check curve2 ownership (first's polyline's vertices = shared's polyline's vertices)
check curve2 ownership (first's polyline's vertices != copied's polyline's vertices)
check curve2 ownership (first's polyline's storage's owner != copied's polyline's storage's owner)
free cad curve first
check carried curve2 shared
check carried curve2 copied
set curves to a list containing shared
append copied to curves
free cad curve shared
free cad curve copied
set retained to the item at 0 in curves
remove item 0 from curves
free curves
check carried curve2 retained
set rangeResult to the cad range of retained's polyline from 0.25 to 0.75
check curve2 ownership rangeResult's valid
set range to rangeResult's value
set rangeClone to the cad clone of range
check curve2 ownership (range = rangeClone)
check curve2 ownership (range's segments != rangeClone's segments)
check curve2 ownership (range's polyline's vertices != rangeClone's polyline's vertices)
set child to range's polyline
set rangeResult to a new (the type of rangeResult)
free cad polyline range range
free cad polyline range rangeClone
free cad curve retained
set midpoint to the cad point on child at 0.5
check curve2 ownership ((the absolute value of (midpoint's y + 1.0)) < 1e-12)
set invalid to the cad range of child from 0.5 to 0.5
check curve2 ownership (invalid's valid = false)
set invalidCopy to invalid
set invalid to a new (the type of invalid)
check curve2 ownership ((the length of invalidCopy's value's segments) = 0)
free cad polyline child

set original to owned curve2 nurbs
set alias to original
set deep to the cad clone of original
check curve2 ownership (original = deep)
check curve2 ownership (original's nurbs's controls = alias's nurbs's controls)
check curve2 ownership (original's nurbs's controls != deep's nurbs's controls)
check curve2 ownership (original's nurbs's knots != deep's nurbs's knots)
check curve2 ownership (original's nurbs's weights != deep's nurbs's weights)
set detached to original's nurbs
insert cad nurbs knot 0.5 into detached
check curve2 ownership ((the length of original's nurbs's controls) = 2)
check curve2 ownership ((the length of detached's controls) = 3)
free cad nurbs detached
set holder to [original,alias,deep,primitive]
free cad curve original
free cad curve alias
free cad curve deep
loop index from 0 to 3:
    check carried curve2 (the item at index in holder)
loop iteration from 0 to 1000:
    set temporary to owned curve2 polyline
    set second to the cad clone of temporary
    set intermediate to the cad range of temporary's polyline from 0.25 to 0.75
    set keep to intermediate's value's polyline
    set intermediate to a new (the type of intermediate)
    check carried curve2 second
    check curve2 ownership ((the length of keep's vertices) = 2)
print "curve2_polyline2_managed_lifetimes" as a line
